Create a new class in a same-named file named `DataService.cs` and paste the following code. This code defines an async Task named `AddDocumentsAsync` add documents to MongoDB. This function uses the [Collection.InsertManyAsync()](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/csharp/current/crud/insert/#std-label-csharp-insert-guide) .NET/C# driver method to insert a list of the `BsonDocument` type. Each document contains:  
